Subject: [PATCH 29/38] feat(omni-tts): wire language + speaker_embedding_b64
 through streaming worker (re-port c48c0de+ba9ecdb worker side)

Turn the M1 accept-and-warn stubs into real pass-through now that the M2
runtime patches exist:

- `language` -> TalkerGenerationRequest::language (CustomVoice 9-row
  language-conditioned prefill; empty/omitted = upstream 8-row path).
- `speaker_embedding_b64` (base64 LE float32 array) -> decoded via
  base64Decode/base64ToFloatVec into TalkerGenerationRequest::speakerEmbedding
  (external speaker-row conditioning; empty = named-speaker token path).

Requests without the new fields behave exactly as before.

